{
    "8": {
        "lines": [
            "　　This is the Ruby's Dark Kingdom. The capital of halloween country.",
            "    A place outside the human world where all The Urban Legends from our world coexists.",
            "    This place is ruled by Ruby Alinsky, The overlord of destruction.",
            "    A girl a bit too full of herself."
        ]
    },
    "12": {
        "lines": [
            "　  Recently, Another october party started after the closure of Makai's black hole.",
            "　　Some of Kidda's siblings insisted her to going to the party.",
            "　　Kidda isn't a party person, But they convinced her to let them go."
        ]
    },
    "17": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"And, here we are.\""
        ]
    },
    "20": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"Woah.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> This Mansion looks so awesome...\""
        ]
    },
    "23": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"Yeah it does.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> It's halloween's overlord own mansion. Lot's of monsters lives here."
        ]
    },
    "26": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"And I was thinking she was too boring to own a mansion this cool!\""
        ]
    },
    "29": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"Nah, She's not boring, Just too egoistic.\""
        ]
    },
    "33": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Kidda. Why do you have clones of yourself...?\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> There's always a new one with you.\""
        ]
    },
    "36": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"They're my siblings. This fatass is kaida.\""
        ]
    },
    "39": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"She's the halloween country president? I was thinking she looked more imponent.\""
        ]
    },
    "42": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"And this other right here is Mina.\""
        ]
    },
    "45": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Mina:$12345678> \"That's me.\""
        ]
    },
    "48": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"It's like a male you and a dumber you.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> all of you guys look the exact same..."
        ]
    },
    "50": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> And how many of you are there!?\""
        ]
    },
    "53": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"Yes. Many...\""
        ]
    },
    "56": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"They were curious about coming to your october party.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> And insisted me to lead them in here, Sadly."
        ]
    },
    "59": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"I'm glad you're helping with it."
        ]
    },
    "61": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> You'll get a 4 percent discount on fish for eternity!\""
        ]
    },
    "64": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"If you even care, That face of yours doesn't tell me you do."
        ]
    },
    "67": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"By the way, I heard about one party being prepared in a haunted mansion!\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Will you guys assist to that one?\""
        ]
    },
    "71": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"That's for the one in the frontier haunted mansion party.\"",
        ]
    },
    "75": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"Eh? That place is a mess, Who's the idiot making a party over there?\""
        ]
    },
    "78": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Mina:$12345678> \"What do you mean it's a mess?\""
        ]
    },
    "81": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Some yokais took the mansion for themselves and blah blah blah.\""
        ]
    },
    "84": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Rudy, How the hell do you know all that?\""
        ]
    },
    "88": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"I had spirits stalking that haunted mansion for me after what Abbey told me.\""
        ]
    },
    "91": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Let's sabotage their stupid boring party.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> And then, let's make them slaves for my mansion of horror.\""
        ]
    },
    "94": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Mina:$12345678> \"I'm with her!\""
        ]
    },
    "97": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"I'll probably eat their souls. Their cries feels good on my belly.\"",
        ]
    },
    "100": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"Rudy what the hell are you talking about?\""
        ]
    },
    "103": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby$12345678> \"Kidda, are your siblings gonna stay here? Or are they going to that party?\""
        ]
    },
    "107": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"They'll probably stay in here for a while, They seem too enjoy this place."
        ]
    },
    "109": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> As for me, I have enough in here. I'll probably go to the Evil water pool.\""
        ]
    },
    "112": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Good choice you grumpy cat.\""
        ]
    },
    "115": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Didn't you said you had enough in here?\""
        ]
    },
    "118": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Ruby's kingdom October party continued.",
            "　　Some sort of celebration after defeating makai's Overlord.",
        ]
    },
    "122": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Good Ending No. 6!",
            "　　The Horrorifying Capital's October party.",
        ]
    }
}